			"date": "2025-10-14T19:30:33.960Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@webreflection\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>webreflection</span></a></span> maybe a little hard to explain on text but given an arbitrary deeply nested object, I want to add metadata to each property that stores an arbitrary string for that property. the approach I’m using is to convert (for boolean types) primitive booleans to object booleans to add that data and retain the same behavior</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
